{"title":"광공이 나를 오작교로 쓰려고 한다","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=uy2Fc/dJMcaiv2WoK/3gh2I0jauBhw8GdwAIc9kK&filename=th3","synopsis":"광공에게 부탁을 받았다.\n\n“너 나 좀 도와줘라.”\n“뭐, 뭘?”\n“내가 그 녀석이랑 잘되게.”\n\n원작의 수와 잘될 수 있도록 도와 달라고.\n\n(억지로) 두 사람의 오작교가 된 재이는\n과연 무사히 역할을 끝내고 원래의 일상으로 돌아갈 수 있을까?\n\n***\n\n“솔직히 말해 봐, 나 정도는 괜찮지 않냐?”\n“얼굴이?”\n“얼굴 말고는?”\n\n정말 어려운 질문이었다.\n끄응, 앓는 소리를 낸 재이는 한이현의 장점을 생각해 봤다.\n얼굴이 예쁘고, 얼굴이 예쁘고…….\n또 뭐가 있더라.\n\n침묵이 길어지자 한이현의 표정이 점점 굳기 시작했다.\n\n\n#책빙의 #학원/캠퍼스물 #오해/착각\n#미인공 #집착공 #외모는여우_속은곰공 #짝사랑공\n#아방수 #얼빠수 #햇살수 #유죄수\n\n\n* 본 작품은 15세 이용가입니다. 감상에 참고하시길 바랍니다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":29,"change":{"type":"up","amount":48}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":32,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":35,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":53,"change":{"type":"down","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":46,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":41,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":38,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":35,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":49,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":44,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":41,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":45,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":42,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":36,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":40,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":46,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":44,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":63,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":69,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":60,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-30"